=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Belgidiveau (A)} at (F-4), the base camp (Veridical Conflux #01).
* Belgidiveau wishes for you to trade him a part of an Abyssean monster, such as NM pop items or a part of a {p:Voragean|Category:Vorageans}.
** Multiple items are "High Strength" and yield the greatest fame/rewards.
*** High Strength items include: {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|3088} {i:Avian Remex|Avian Remex|3088}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|3103} {i:Black Whisker|Black Whisker|3103}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|3106} {i:Djinn Ashes|Djinn Ashes|3106}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|3105} {i:Fortune Wing|Fortune Wing|3105}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|3098} {i:Gnarled Taurus Horn|Gnarled Taurus Horn|3098}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|3079} {i:Gory Pincer|Gory Pincer|3079}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|2916} {i:High-Quality Limule Pincer|High-Quality Limule Pincer|2916}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|3109} {i:High-Quality Rabbit Hide|High-Quality Rabbit Hide|3109}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|3092} {i:Mocking Beak|Mocking Beak|3092}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|3104} {i:Opaque Wing|Opaque Wing|3104}, {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|2897} {i:Transparent Insect Wing|Transparent Insect Wing|2897}
** Many other items work. They tend to be tier 1 NM pop items that drop from ordinary monsters within Abyssea.
*** Two stackable items that work are {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|2641} {i:Amoeban Pseudopod|Amoeban Pseudopod|2641} and {@i:\{\{\{2\}\}\}px|2888} {i:Sanguinets|Sanguinet|2888}. Both of these drop off {m:Stream Amoebans|Stream Amoeban} nearby.
**** 50 total quest completions with either of these items will max fame in this zone.
** No {p:Magian Trial} drops work.

__Zoning is not required to repeat this quest.__
